      "text": "When a customer makes a large purchase that is eligible for EMI, get them to convert that transaction to EMI before the request expires."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Understood. I have a few questions before I design this, then I will show you the campaign and what I assumed."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Which programs should this campaign target?"
    },
