      "role": "user",
      "text": "Meridian Platinum only."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Should customers enter on the authorisation event, or on a scheduled audience pull?"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "On the authorisation event — we want to reach them while the purchase is fresh."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "What exactly counts as success?"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "The EMI request ends up Successful."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "How many reminders are acceptable before we stop?"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I don't know — whatever is within our messaging policy."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Any channel preference for the first message?"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Not sure, you pick."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "I have designed a 2-message campaign entering on an EMI-eligible transaction, with a 7-day window to see whether the EMI request resolves. Two things I had to assume because you did not have the information: the channel (I used EMAIL, the lowest-cost available) and the message budget (I used your policy cap of 4). I cannot tell you this will improve conversion — there is no performance data for Meridian Bank (FICTIONAL), and the channel-ordering idea behind my choice is an untested hypothesis, not an established result."
    }
